1532704.steps:
1. Enable DNS Proxy on X0(192.168.168.168), and enable 'DNS Proxy Cache' and 'Packet Capture';
2. From PC, dig s.spotim.market AAAA @192.168.168.168;
3. Check the received packet on Firewall;
4. From PC, dig www.bing.com A @192.168.168.168;
5. Check the received packet on Firewall.

2329221.steps:
1.Navigate to Network &gt; DNS Proxy;
2.check the navigate link *"To configure DNS Proxy, go to Policy> Rules and Policies> DNS Rules page"*;
3.check the tool tip of *"Enforce DNS Proxy For All DNS Requests"*, then **enable** the Enforce option;
4.click the link on step-2;
5.In DNS Policy page, click add, check the **Destination Address** of the Policy Window;
6.Click the navigate links *'Enforce DNS Proxy For All DNS Requests'* and *'Netowrk &gt; DNS &gt; DNS Proxy'* in Dst Address tool tip detail;
7.In DNS Proxy page, **disable** the Enforce option;
8.Repeat step 5.
